{"meta":{"id":"kitsu:50338","kitsu_id":"50338","type":"series","animeType":"TV","name":"Mahou Shoujo Ikusei Keikaku: restart","slug":"mahou-shoujo-ikusei-keikaku-restart","aliases":["Magical Girl Raising Project: restart","Mahou Shoujo Ikusei Keikaku: restart"],"genres":["Drama"],"logo":"https://assets.fanart.tv/fanart/magical-girl-raising-project-restart-68f871a75d350.png","poster":"https://images.metahub.space/poster/small/tt39240299/img","background":"https://images.metahub.space/background/medium/tt39240299/img","description":"A stage reading in the Magical Girl Raising Project franchise announced that an anime adaptation of Asari Endou's Magical Girl Raising Project Restart light novel volumes has been green-lit. Hiroyuki Hashimoto reported on Twitter that he will return from the first Magical Girl Raising Project anime as the director. The franchise's Twitter account also teased that various initiatives are in the works for \"Project restart.\"","releaseInfo":"2026-","year":"2026-","userCount":140,"status":"current","trailers":[{"source":"-PX7FqZ55tE","type":"Trailer"}],"videos":[{"id":"kitsu:50338:1","title":"Hello, Daisy","released":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/1/w780.jpg","overview":"Pechka is an unassuming magical girl whose magic lets her make delicious food, which she uses to prepare a lunch for the boy she has a crush on. Her modest everyday life changes completely when she is forcibly abducted into an ominous game world. Sixteen magical girls have been gathered there alongside Pechka. In this artificial virtual space, the curtain quietly rises on a nightmare that is as beautiful as it is cruel.","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":1,"absoluteEpisode":1},{"id":"kitsu:50338:2","title":"The Players","released":"2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/2/w780.jpg","overview":"Sixteen magical girls have been assembled in a vast virtual world. The electronic fairy Fal announces a team competition with a 10-billion-yen grand prize, where players must collect “Candy.” With Pechka panicking over her complete lack of combat ability, Clantail takes the lead in redistributing the Candy. But could this become the seed of quiet mistrust among the group?","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":2,"absoluteEpisode":2},{"id":"kitsu:50338:3","title":"Delicious Food Makes Everyone Happy","released":"2026-10-20T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/3/w780.jpg","overview":"Pechka and Nako begin exploring the grasslands, making their way past traps and opening a treasure chest filled with a huge amount of Candy. Their relief is short-lived when a mysterious forced-transport system activates, dragging every player into the plaza! Meanwhile, Akane continues her unsettling solo movements. In an instant, the game begins to tilt toward catastrophe.","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":3,"absoluteEpisode":3},{"id":"kitsu:50338:4","title":"The Detective and the Murder","released":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/4/w780.jpg","overview":"Daisy, who was supposed to have merely been eliminated from the game, suddenly dies under mysterious circumstances in the real world. When detective Detec Bell makes a shocking accusation, Fal confirms the cruel truth and declares that clearing the game is the only path to survival! Then Masked Wonder’s mutilated body is discovered, and a search begins for the culprit behind the theft of a rare item.","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":4,"absoluteEpisode":4},{"id":"kitsu:50338:5","title":"The Mysterious Candy","released":"2026-11-03T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/5/w780.jpg","overview":"A giant robot and a gigantic Cherna clash spectacularly in the wasteland over an item! Pechka and the others advance into a new underground area, the “Limestone Cave,” defeating monsters along the way. But just before they log out, Fal announces a merciless new rule. With death only 15 minutes away, a desperate race against time for survival begins!","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":5,"absoluteEpisode":5},{"id":"kitsu:50338:6","title":"The Giant Dragon and the Chinese Girl","released":"2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/6/w780.jpg","overview":"","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":6,"absoluteEpisode":6},{"id":"kitsu:50338:7","title":"Episode 7","released":"2026-11-17T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":7,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/7/w780.jpg","overview":"","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":7,"absoluteEpisode":7},{"id":"kitsu:50338:8","title":"Episode 8","released":"2026-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":8,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/8/w780.jpg","overview":"","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":8,"absoluteEpisode":8},{"id":"kitsu:50338:9","title":"Episode 9","released":"2026-12-01T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":9,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/9/w780.jpg","overview":"","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":9,"absoluteEpisode":9},{"id":"kitsu:50338:10","title":"Episode 10","released":"2026-12-08T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":10,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/10/w780.jpg","overview":"","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":10,"absoluteEpisode":10},{"id":"kitsu:50338:11","title":"Episode 11","released":"2026-12-15T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":11,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt39240299/1/11/w780.jpg","overview":"","imdb_id":"tt39240299","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":11,"absoluteEpisode":11